\description{
Provides an R interface to interact with the Regulatory In-lieu fee and Bank Information Tracking System (RIBITS) API. This package facilitates the download and analysis of mitigation banking data directly within R.

The RIBITSr package provides a streamlined interface to the RIBITS
(Regulatory In-lieu fee and Bank Information Tracking System) API
and EPA ArcGIS MapServer for mitigation banking data.
}
